[Script]

贴吧-信息流广告净化 = type=http-response,pattern=^https:\/\/tiebac\.baidu\.com\/c\/f\/ad\/getFeedAd(?:\?|$),requires-body=true,max-size=-1,binary-body-mode=true,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Feng-Feng1/surge/refs/heads/main/Tieba-AdFilter-Test.js?v=1,timeout=30

贴吧-开屏广告净化 = type=http-response,pattern=^https:\/\/tiebac\.baidu\.com\/c\/f\/ad\/getSplashAd(?:\?|$),requires-body=true,max-size=-1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Feng-Feng1/surge/refs/heads/main/Tieba-AdFilter-Test.js?v=1,timeout=30

